            "frametrail:name": "6:07 pm: a second fire",
            "frametrail:attributes": {
                "text": "&lt;div class=&quot;dossierNote&quot; data-layer=&quot;4&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;dossierLayer&quot;&gt;Findings&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;dossierTitle&quot;&gt;6:07 pm: a second fire&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A new, intense source of heat appears on the north-west side, followed by a larger plume. The sparks suggest small explosive charges such as fireworks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;"
